--[[

This minigame script takes all of the minigames under game.Lighting.Choices as models.
The minigames need to have the following things:

**A wait time of 7 seconds at the beginning in the game's game script. (states stuff to players)
**A miniature game script (obviously)
**An StringValue called Winner (tells who won this thingy)
**A script or some method that can tell who won, and adds the winner's name to the StringValue "Winner"
**A Color3 Value called Ambience (change the theme/element of the place)
**A part(s) called Spawn (players will spawn here)
**A StringValue called Objective (a game message)
**A StringValue called Instructions (a hint)
**An IntValue called TimeLimit (a time limit)
**A BoolValue called KillAllIfNotFinished (check this if you want everyone to fail if time runs out)

Other things:

**People who are playing the minigames have the intvalue called "Playing" in their character.
**Comes with a minigame choice system
]]--
